    (v_chapter, 'mcq', 'scenario', 'bank', 5, 'A standard commercial elevator is moving downward toward the ground floor at a high, completely uniform, unchanging velocity. If a passenger stands on a digital weighing scale inside this elevator, what value will the display show?', '["True weight","Zero weight","Double weight","Slightly lower weight"]'::jsonb, 'A', 1, '46caee6ca981', null),
    (v_chapter, 'mcq', 'scenario', 'bank', 5, 'Two interacting bodies form an isolated system. During a complex, multi-stage collision between them, what can be scientifically concluded about their individual linear momentums?', '["Both change","Both stay constant","Only the lighter changes","Both instantly become zero"]'::jsonb, 'A', 1, '24bc5e43b0c3', null),
